+# Owner prerequisite engineering revision 3
+
+Stable source handoff for spec review iteration 3. All nine retained engineering outcomes are implemented and focused verified. **Root full Local verification and the next independent three-layer review remain pending.** Production enrollment, current independent authorities, qualified backends/providers/replicas/anchors/isolation/all-copy destruction/restore and full Live acceptance remain unestablished.
