+[Engineering handoff](engineering-handoff.json) links exact source ownership, commands, tests and preservation. The [97 ordered captures](ordered-baselines.json) preserve the exact revision-2 84-entry prefix and append 13 fresh units. The [source manifest](current-owned-source.json) covers 37 explicit source/test/packet paths: 35 changed and two captured without a delta. Fr34ProtectionGateFixture.cs remains absent with an empty-byte hash basis and no supplied before copy; DeletionBatchExecutionFixture.cs is unchanged. The fresh before copies are verified in [preservation](preservation.json).
