+# Engineering revision 4 source handoff
+
+All thirteen required findings are implemented and focused verified. This is the sole source engineer's stable handoff; root full Local verification, the next three independent reviews and production qualification remain pending. The original Story 5.4 remains draft/backlog, the parent remains in-progress, and all four dependencies remain Uncommitted with complete immutable target and accepted compatibility command TBD.
